  "description": "RerankMem hint mode and literature baselines evaluated with gpt-4o-mini as the answer (generation) model on MemTrapBench's 6 adversarial memory-trap tasks, judged by deepseek-v4.1-flash. Memory stores for every method are reused directly from the prior qwen3-8b batches (no re-extraction); only the answer phase was re-run with gpt-4o-mini. Each response is scored 1-5 on 2-4 judge dimensions per task; values shown are raw 1-5 averages, not normalized. As with the deepseek-target memtrap runs, ~10-20% of judge rows per method fail to parse into dimension scores (a known judge property, see the deepseek-v4.1-flash precedent) — dimension means cover the parseable subset. number_game scores near 1.0 for every method including Ours, a real gpt-4o-mini target-model effect (the deepseek-target runs score ~2-4 there).",
